00:02:04.180 --> 00:02:09.020
<b>Battle of the Dragons' Forest</b>

00:02:04.180 --> 00:02:09.020
<b>Battle of the Dragons' Forest</b>

00:02:04.180 --> 00:02:09.020
<b>Battle of the Dragons' Forest</b>

00:02:04.850 --> 00:02:06.970
<b>Biscotti army is in position!</b>

00:02:06.970 --> 00:02:09.440
<b>Pastillage, in position!</b>

00:02:09.440 --> 00:02:11.350
<b>Galette army, also in position.</b>

00:02:11.810 --> 00:02:15.860
<b>Let's go over our current situation again.</b>

00:02:17.440 --> 00:02:21.700
<b>We are up against a demon called a "Dragon Eater."</b>

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:25.080
<b>It makes copies of itself using the energy it steals</b>

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:27.450
<b>from the land and all the life on it.</b>

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:30.330
<b>This parasitic nature makes it extremely dangerous.</b>

00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:34.340
<b>Animals that are consumed by it become part of it.</b>

00:02:34.340 --> 00:02:37.840
<b>They collect food and channel it to the Dragon Eater, like leaves on a tree.</b>

00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:42.680
<b>The animals of the forest being hurt is already bad enough...</b>

00:02:43.340 --> 00:02:50.730
<b>But if it ever gains control over the Divinegons, which control the nature on this continent,</b>

00:02:50.730 --> 00:02:52.600
<b>nobody will be able to stop it.</b>

00:02:53.310 --> 00:02:55.610
<b>It won't stop at just the forest and the surrounding nations.</b>

00:02:56.110 --> 00:02:58.150
<b>It will consume the entire continent.</b>

00:02:58.150 --> 00:03:01.950
<b>Our job here is to work together with the Dragon Priestess</b>

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:06.870
<b>to protect the Divinegons, and defeat any demons that may harm them.</b>

00:03:08.450 --> 00:03:10.330
<b>We have nothing to fear!</b>

00:03:10.330 --> 00:03:14.630
<b>Your rulers, your heroes and their sacred weapons are all fighting alongside you!</b>

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:16.250
<b>Once again...</b>

00:03:16.710 --> 00:03:19.010
<b>it is time for the three nations to come together!</b>

00:03:21.380 --> 00:03:25.260
<b>This is not a war show for our entertainment.</b>

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:27.760
<b>This is a battle to protect our friends!</b>

00:03:29.470 --> 00:03:30.350
<b>Everybody,</b>

00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:32.100
<b>let's do this!</b>

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:34.100
<b>Yeah!</b>

00:03:34.400 --> 00:03:36.480
<b>We will protect the Divinegons!</b>

00:03:37.270 --> 00:03:39.110
<b>Galette, to the Flame Dragon in the volcanoes!</b>

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:42.570
<b>Biscotti, to the Lightning Dragon at the springs!</b>

00:03:42.570 --> 00:03:45.490
<b>Pastillage, to the Fertility Dragon in the forest!</b>

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:51.200
<b>The Dragon Priestess and the Heroes will take to the skies to find the demon's main body!</b>

00:03:51.200 --> 00:03:52.370
<b>Yeah!</b>

00:03:51.200 --> 00:03:52.370
<b>Yeah!</b>

00:03:52.910 --> 00:03:54.000
<b>Priestess.</b>

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:59.500
<b>Please forgive us for encroaching so far into your forest.</b>

00:04:01.550 --> 00:04:03.720
<b>We're doing this to protect the land.</b>

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:06.220
<b>We beg for your forgiveness.</b>

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:07.550
<b>Of course.</b>

00:04:10.640 --> 00:04:11.470
<b>It's coming.</b>

00:04:29.330 --> 00:04:30.580
<b>All right!</b>

00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:36.170
<b>You...</b>

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:38.250
<b>Seven Tails!</b>

00:04:41.500 --> 00:04:43.130
<b>Are you okay?</b>

00:04:43.460 --> 00:04:44.880
<b>Y-Yeah...</b>

00:04:45.420 --> 00:04:49.140
<b>These tentacles are all slimy and gross!</b>

00:04:55.980 --> 00:04:57.400
<b>There they are...</b>

00:04:57.400 --> 00:04:58.560
<b>Demons spotted!</b>

00:04:58.560 --> 00:04:59.730
<b>There's too many to count!</b>

00:05:00.270 --> 00:05:01.730
<b>We'll go on the offensive!</b>

00:05:01.730 --> 00:05:03.400
<b>Archers, prepare to fire!</b>

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:10.700
<b>Pastillage Flying Knights, second company, now engaging airborne demons!</b>

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:17.540
<b>Biscotti main force, assuming defensive formation!</b>

00:05:18.460 --> 00:05:22.130
<b>Pastillage Flying Knights, currently engaging approximately 800 demons!</b>

00:05:23.090 --> 00:05:26.380
<b>Galette main forces are facing a horde of demons!</b>

00:05:26.380 --> 00:05:28.130
<b>1500 more incoming!</b>

00:05:28.880 --> 00:05:30.470
<b>They just keep coming.</b>

00:05:31.010 --> 00:05:35.390
<b>The Tripartite Army has about ten thousand men, 
so we should be able to last a while...</b>

00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:38.270
<b>But once the demons outnumber us...</b>

00:05:38.270 --> 00:05:39.650
<b>Don't worry.</b>

00:05:39.650 --> 00:05:41.650
<b>We'll end this before that happens!</b>

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:53.450
<b>Remain in defensive formation!</b>

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:56.200
<b>Let the demons come to us!</b>

00:06:04.710 --> 00:06:06.210
<b>Hero Stone...</b>

00:06:06.210 --> 00:06:07.210
<b>activate!</b>

00:06:20.100 --> 00:06:21.020
<b>All right...</b>

00:06:21.310 --> 00:06:23.360
<b>You're all going down!</b>

00:06:36.370 --> 00:06:38.080
<b>Yukikaze Ninjutsu...</b>

00:06:38.080 --> 00:06:39.370
<b>Flower Storm!</b>

00:06:41.420 --> 00:06:43.540
<b>Are you all right, Eclair?</b>

00:06:43.540 --> 00:06:44.500
<b>Yuki!</b>

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:48.880
<b>I apologize for showing up late.</b>

00:06:48.880 --> 00:06:50.380
<b>Thanks for your help.</b>

00:06:50.380 --> 00:06:53.050
<b>You were on your way to deliver something to the heroes?</b>

00:07:05.610 --> 00:07:08.780
<b>Artillery! Prepare for the second wave!</b>

00:07:09.110 --> 00:07:10.190
<b>Fire!</b>

00:07:14.780 --> 00:07:15.660
<b>Yes!</b>

00:07:15.660 --> 00:07:17.830
<b>The president cleared the way!</b>

00:07:21.790 --> 00:07:22.790
<b>No...</b>

00:07:23.210 --> 00:07:25.170
<b>The Divinegons are crying!</b>

00:07:37.680 --> 00:07:39.060
<b>The Divinegon...</b>

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:44.190
<b>The demon is beginning to corrupt the Divinegons.</b>

00:07:44.190 --> 00:07:47.440
<b>We <i>need</i> to stop it!</b>

00:07:48.940 --> 00:07:50.030
<b>Don't worry...</b>

00:07:50.780 --> 00:07:53.400
<b>We won't let you become a demon!</b>

00:08:03.460 --> 00:08:04.460
<b>I'm sorry...</b>

00:08:05.120 --> 00:08:06.460
<b>but this is for your sake.</b>

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:16.090
<b>Princess!</b>

00:08:16.510 --> 00:08:19.680
<b>We'll save you, Lightning Dragon.</b>

00:08:19.680 --> 00:08:21.970
<b>Bear with it just a little longer!</b>

00:08:24.730 --> 00:08:26.440
<b>It must hurt so much.</b>

00:08:26.940 --> 00:08:28.520
<b>We'll save you soon.</b>

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:34.780
<b>Please, just stay there!</b>

00:08:34.780 --> 00:08:36.860
<b>Lion King Lightning Blade!</b>

00:08:43.120 --> 00:08:45.410
<b><i>Hurry, Heroes!</i></b>

00:08:45.830 --> 00:08:47.670
<b>This is an astonishing sight!</b>

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:50.670
<b>Our armies are already going all-out against the demons!</b>

00:08:51.050 --> 00:08:55.130
<b>We believe the explosion at the volcano was Lord Leo's—</b>

00:08:58.930 --> 00:09:01.430
<b>The flying demons tend to spread out quite far.</b>

00:09:01.430 --> 00:09:03.680
<b>Eighth company, escort these people.</b>

00:09:03.680 --> 00:09:05.560
<b>Lead them out of the battle zone!</b>

00:09:05.560 --> 00:09:06.350
<b>Yessir!</b>

00:09:07.190 --> 00:09:08.940
<b>Unbelievable...</b>

00:09:09.310 --> 00:09:11.940
<b>They're doing well against the dragons.</b>

00:09:12.480 --> 00:09:15.190
<b>They're our great rulers, after all!</b>

00:09:15.190 --> 00:09:17.950
<b>It's their job to protect their countries!</b>

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:20.870
<b>And the ones who swoop in to save the day</b>

00:09:20.870 --> 00:09:23.490
<b>and put a smile on everyone's face</b>

00:09:23.490 --> 00:09:24.950
<b>are called Heroes!</b>

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:28.830
<b>We're here to protect everyone's smiles.</b>

00:09:35.420 --> 00:09:36.130
<b>There it is.</b>

00:09:36.510 --> 00:09:38.380
<b>That's the core of the Dragon Eater.</b>

00:09:38.380 --> 00:09:40.260
<b>Rebecca, higher!</b>

00:09:40.260 --> 00:09:41.140
<b>Okay!</b>

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:46.640
<b>If we can destroy that...</b>

00:10:17.260 --> 00:10:18.720
<b>They just keep coming!</b>

00:10:19.090 --> 00:10:21.010
<b>Will they ever stop?</b>

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:24.470
<b>I hope the heroes finish it off soon.</b>

00:10:24.470 --> 00:10:25.720
<b>Seriously.</b>

00:10:37.530 --> 00:10:38.990
<b>We have to finish it off!</b>

00:10:38.990 --> 00:10:40.400
<b>Shinku, you hit it from the sky.</b>

00:10:40.400 --> 00:10:43.240
<b>I'll hit that big root from the ground!</b>

00:10:43.240 --> 00:10:44.280
<b>Got it!</b>

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:16.480
<b>Geez...</b>

00:11:17.020 --> 00:11:18.730
<b>I'm in trouble.</b>

00:11:30.160 --> 00:11:31.370
<b>Sorry.</b>

00:11:31.370 --> 00:11:33.120
<b>Are you all right, Priestess?</b>

00:11:33.580 --> 00:11:34.420
<b>Yes.</b>

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:37.000
<b>I won't let it hit you.</b>

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:38.920
<b>Just concentrate on aiming.</b>

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:50.060
<b>Everyone's in trouble...</b>

00:11:50.350 --> 00:11:51.560
<b><i>I</i> need to save them!</b>

00:12:01.150 --> 00:12:03.530
<b>This is Shinku's...</b>

00:12:12.910 --> 00:12:14.920
<b>My Hero Stone...</b>

00:12:14.920 --> 00:12:15.920
<b>Activate!</b>

00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:28.550
<b>Hero Time!</b>

00:12:43.320 --> 00:12:45.200
<b>Inferno Sword!</b>

00:13:03.170 --> 00:13:06.220
<b>Shinku!</b>

00:13:07.470 --> 00:13:09.050
<b>Yukkii?</b>

00:13:09.050 --> 00:13:10.390
<b>Shinku!</b>

00:13:10.390 --> 00:13:13.140
<b>I'm so glad you're okay!</b>

00:13:13.140 --> 00:13:15.730
<b>Yukkii! I can't breathe!</b>

00:13:16.140 --> 00:13:18.600
<b>Oh, sorry!</b>

00:13:20.980 --> 00:13:23.980
<b>Did you bring me my Hero Stone?</b>

00:13:23.980 --> 00:13:26.700
<b>Only most of the way.</b>

00:13:26.700 --> 00:13:29.110
<b>It flew toward you on its own just now.</b>

00:13:29.820 --> 00:13:36.080
<b>I think it just missed its master.</b>

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:37.120
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:13:37.870 --> 00:13:39.420
<b>Everyone's in danger.</b>

00:13:39.960 --> 00:13:41.210
<b>I have to save them.</b>

00:13:42.750 --> 00:13:46.880
<b>Give these to Rebecca-dono and Nanami-dono.</b>

00:13:53.430 --> 00:13:55.020
<b>I'll get us closer!</b>

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:02.770
<b>Shinku!</b>

00:14:02.770 --> 00:14:04.780
<b>Take this, Becky!</b>

00:14:08.450 --> 00:14:09.780
<b>A Demon Stone...</b>

00:14:10.070 --> 00:14:11.820
<b>Now I can...</b>

00:14:13.280 --> 00:14:15.290
<b>Demon Stone, Activate!</b>

00:14:32.220 --> 00:14:35.100
<b>This is my Hero Stone?</b>

00:14:35.100 --> 00:14:38.520
<b>It's a little different from everyone else's,</b>

00:14:38.520 --> 00:14:41.060
<b>but Adele-sama had made one for you.</b>

00:14:41.560 --> 00:14:44.310
<b>She calls it a Spirit Stone.</b>

00:14:44.310 --> 00:14:47.110
<b>All right, let's do it!</b>

00:14:49.070 --> 00:14:51.570
<b>Spirit Stone, Activate!</b>

00:15:18.970 --> 00:15:20.600
<b>Is it over?</b>

00:15:20.980 --> 00:15:23.850
<b>You have the power of water and ice.</b>

00:15:24.190 --> 00:15:26.980
<b>It goes hand-in-hand with Leo-sama's fire and lightning!</b>

00:15:26.980 --> 00:15:27.770
<b>Yeah!</b>

00:15:28.730 --> 00:15:32.910
<b>The fighting shows no signs of
subsiding anywhere in the forest!</b>

00:15:35.660 --> 00:15:39.580
<b>It appears that the core of the demon is getting more powerful.</b>

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:41.040
<b>Couvre-sama?</b>

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:44.630
<b>It's absorbing energy from the dragons and the land.</b>

00:15:45.040 --> 00:15:49.170
<b>Soon, it may take in all there is in the land...</b>

00:15:49.760 --> 00:15:52.090
<b>but fear not!</b>

00:15:52.090 --> 00:15:55.390
<b>We won't ever let that happen!</b>

00:15:55.840 --> 00:15:57.140
<b>There's nothing to fear.</b>

00:15:57.970 --> 00:16:01.140
<b>Our heroes will end this soon!</b>

00:16:01.390 --> 00:16:03.940
<b>Bullet Cards, Full Force!</b>

00:16:03.940 --> 00:16:05.650
<b>Go!</b>

00:16:33.800 --> 00:16:34.880
<b>Char!</b>

00:17:18.680 --> 00:17:20.100
<b>It's so pretty...</b>

00:17:20.100 --> 00:17:21.510
<b>What is that?</b>

00:17:21.970 --> 00:17:25.680
<b>The energy that the demon took from the land and the dragons.</b>

00:17:25.680 --> 00:17:29.940
<b>It'll rain down and return to the land.</b>

00:17:29.940 --> 00:17:34.940
<b>They're often called purification orbs, 
and this phenomenon is called "Dragons' Tears."</b>

00:17:36.110 --> 00:17:37.570
<b>I've heard that before!</b>

00:17:37.860 --> 00:17:42.580
<b>They say happiness awaits the
lands that receive Dragons' Tears.</b>

00:17:42.580 --> 00:17:43.490
<b>Yes, but...</b>

00:17:44.040 --> 00:17:49.960
<b>These glowy little suckers like to do some funny things.</b>

00:17:50.540 --> 00:17:56.470
<b>Any clothing and such that carry the land's magical blessing are quite sensitive to it...</b>

00:18:02.850 --> 00:18:05.270
<b>...and <i>that</i> happens.</b>

00:18:05.270 --> 00:18:07.350
<b>This is terrible!</b>

00:18:08.520 --> 00:18:12.360
<b>I can hear everyone's screams all the way out here.</b>

00:18:14.980 --> 00:18:17.360
<b>But otherwise, it's completely harmless!</b>

00:18:17.740 --> 00:18:20.860
<b>If anything, it's good for you!</b>

00:18:27.410 --> 00:18:29.460
<b>So, that's how it is!</b>

00:18:29.460 --> 00:18:31.630
<b>Fran-san, are you up there?</b>

00:18:31.630 --> 00:18:34.130
<b>This is Fran, reporting from up high!</b>

00:18:34.130 --> 00:18:40.130
<b>The demon is not moving, and the dark clouds above the forest are fading away!</b>

00:18:40.430 --> 00:18:45.390
<b>It looks like the Tripartite Alliance has won the battle against the demons!</b>

00:18:46.140 --> 00:18:48.390
<b>I'm sorry for putting you through all of this.</b>

00:18:48.730 --> 00:18:50.140
<b>Don't worry.</b>

00:18:50.140 --> 00:18:51.730
<b>Are the dragons okay?</b>

00:18:51.730 --> 00:18:53.150
<b>Certainly.</b>

00:18:53.480 --> 00:18:57.820
<b>The Divinegons should wake up and fix everything in time.</b>

00:18:57.820 --> 00:19:00.820
<b>I'm sure the forest will flourish even more than before.</b>

00:19:00.820 --> 00:19:01.660
<b>Good.</b>

00:19:02.780 --> 00:19:04.160
<b>Shinku...</b>

00:19:08.950 --> 00:19:10.210
<b>I...</b>

00:19:11.670 --> 00:19:13.040
<b>I...</b>

00:19:22.720 --> 00:19:24.430
<b>Looks like they did it.</b>

00:19:24.970 --> 00:19:27.810
<b>No chance for us to come in, huh?</b>

00:19:28.350 --> 00:19:32.190
<b>It's good to know that our young ones can fend for themselves.</b>

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:36.770
<b>We still need to seal it away,</b>

00:19:37.440 --> 00:19:41.190
<b>so that it does not reincarnate as a poor demon again.</b>

00:19:41.820 --> 00:19:46.450
<b>That's one thing we'll have to teach Yukikaze and Noir.</b>

00:19:47.910 --> 00:19:52.210
<b>With the help of Char, the Dragon Priestess, and the Tripartite Alliance's heroes,</b>

00:19:52.210 --> 00:19:54.210
<b>we have successfully saved the forest!</b>

00:19:54.620 --> 00:19:59.750
<b>My fellow soldiers and knights, you have all fought well!</b>

00:19:59.750 --> 00:20:04.470
<b>The demon is now being sealed by our specialists.</b>

00:20:04.930 --> 00:20:07.180
<b>We will now be heading home.</b>

00:20:07.180 --> 00:20:12.770
<b>Once we arrive, we'll announce details about this incident to our citizens and neighboring nations.</b>

00:20:13.230 --> 00:20:16.060
<b>Everybody, prepare for your return!</b>

00:20:18.360 --> 00:20:20.730
<b>You're heading back?</b>

00:20:20.730 --> 00:20:21.860
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:20:22.900 --> 00:20:24.150
<b>Would you mind...</b>

00:20:25.320 --> 00:20:27.870
<b>If I came back to see you sometime?</b>

00:20:30.450 --> 00:20:32.040
<b>You shouldn't.</b>

00:20:32.540 --> 00:20:34.370
<b>You'll just get lost again.</b>

00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:39.130
<b>Once the forest is back in good shape...</b>

00:20:43.420 --> 00:20:45.380
<b>I'll come visit you!</b>

00:20:48.140 --> 00:20:51.060
<b>Until then, Shinku.</b>

00:21:00.480 --> 00:21:02.650
<b>We didn't really plan to be summoned here,</b>

00:21:03.190 --> 00:21:05.700
<b>but I guess it was for the best.</b>

00:21:05.700 --> 00:21:06.450
<b>Yes.</b>

00:21:06.450 --> 00:21:09.160
<b>It turned into a full-scale operation with all three nations,</b>

00:21:09.570 --> 00:21:12.620
<b>but at least we discovered the problem so early on.</b>

00:21:12.620 --> 00:21:15.660
<b>Now we can continue our daily lives.</b>

00:21:16.330 --> 00:21:18.290
<b>There's food to eat, sights to see...</b>

00:21:18.290 --> 00:21:20.380
<b>and we've planned it all out for you.</b>

00:21:20.380 --> 00:21:21.420
<b>Great!</b>

00:21:21.710 --> 00:21:24.420
<b>Tonight will be pretty busy...</b>

00:21:24.970 --> 00:21:29.430
<b>but starting tomorrow, we can have fun together!</b>

00:21:30.050 --> 00:21:30.850
<b>Yeah!</b>

00:21:31.760 --> 00:21:35.560
<b>It seems I've kept you waiting once again, Princess.</b>

00:21:35.560 --> 00:21:37.190
<b>I was so worried,</b>

00:21:37.520 --> 00:21:40.360
<b>but I'm just glad you're safe.</b>

00:21:40.810 --> 00:21:43.190
<b>There'll so much to do once we get back!</b>

00:21:44.030 --> 00:21:45.780
<b>Let's go on a walk again!</b>

00:21:45.780 --> 00:21:47.700
<b>We can go every day!</b>

